/dist/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store

# Local scratch harnesses parked inside a crate's `tests/`. Anything under `tests/` is a cargo
# integration-test target: it compiles on every `cargo test -p <crate>` and `git add -A` would
# commit it. Name scratch files `*_scratch.rs` so neither can happen by accident. A sweep or probe
# worth keeping does NOT belong here — promote it to `examples/`, where it is committed and
# documented but stays out of the per-env-var test census `release/real-weight-models.toml` keeps
# (see `mlx-gen-qwen-image/examples/qwen_compiled_glue_sweep.rs`, sc-17513).
#
# Anchored to `tests/` on purpose. Unanchored, this would swallow a `*_scratch.rs` anywhere in the
# tree — including `src/` — where the file is real source: it would build for its author and be
# missing, silently, from every other checkout.
**/tests/*_scratch.rs
